    "_note": "Independent Chinese-LLM head-to-head comparison covering 6 frontier Chinese models on 5 practical scenarios (long document, code, professional writing, data analysis, research+planning). Each scenario scored 0-20. Composite leaderboard: 0.8 effect + 0.1 cost + 0.1 speed. All 6 models already in DB. 5 new benchmarks + 1 composite + 5 sub-rank meta benchmarks = 9 unique benchmark IDs. 54 score triples (6 models × 9 benchmarks)."
  },
